    <string name="welcome_title">jonngol kiisima e ylih</string>
    <string name="welcome_intro">ylih notere waktu peere hiirde miiɗum keewdo, haŋka yaawde ɓe waawi ko jaybade roggo duuɗe maɓɓe sella peere: waktuuji njooni ko faareema?</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_auto_title">seedd\'a kana sagal</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_auto_body">hiirde bluetooth notere kaɗtee hoo, to peere seedd\'u. alaa sifa mum danɓal ko tee hakkunde.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_title">peere duuɗe, ndiyam duuɗe</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_body">peere cuɓo, dum binde: liseede feewo cugal, peere kadi hiirde suutaa sey jiiɗɓal humpito e nolla.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_title">kaable e sekii</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_body">haasiraa jamano, e teggite, dan kaable hiirde e mesur waktu sekii. android-a ngol ɗee gaŋki kaable hadde ko njawla ko ko-sey, haŋka dina tule yiitere koom. bluetooth haasiraa ko-waawi haa ko-haa.</string>
    <string name="welcome_privacy">haɓunde foofe ngon telefoonaagu. alaa koonjo, alaa permisyon intarnet.</string>
